<title>UK: Cargolux to buy fifth 747-400 freighter.</title>
<headline>Cargolux to buy fifth 747-400 freighter.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargolux Airlines International said Thursday it has decided to purchase a fifth 747-400 freighter from Boeing Co.</p>
<p>The aircraft will be delivered in November 1997 and will be the second 747-400F to be delivered to Cargolux this year. The other aircraft, ordered previously, will join the fleet in August 1997.</p>
<p>When the aircraft are delivered, Cargolux will be operating an all-cargo fleet of five 747-400Fs and four 747-200Fs.</p>
<p>-- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
